What are you thinking, you stupid dog?

00:17:57.050 --> 00:18:00.620
Ryona-chan, Ryobi-chan,
and Mirai are all out!

00:18:02.050 --> 00:18:03.960
Only three players left now:

00:18:03.960 --> 00:18:06.740
Homura-chan, Yumi-chan,
and Miyabi-chan!

00:18:06.740 --> 00:18:09.310
It's time for the three team
captains to have a final battle!

00:18:09.310 --> 00:18:10.970
This is the end!

00:18:10.970 --> 00:18:12.320
Hebijo will be the victors!

00:18:12.320 --> 00:18:13.820
I won't lose!

00:18:27.160 --> 00:18:28.500
What?

00:18:33.510 --> 00:18:35.330
And that's the game!

00:18:35.330 --> 00:18:38.010
All three of you shot
each other, so it's a tie!

00:18:38.010 --> 00:18:39.580
A tie?!

00:18:39.580 --> 00:18:40.670
I refuse to accept this!

00:18:40.670 --> 00:18:43.080
I was the last one!

00:18:43.080 --> 00:18:43.940
The tape!

00:18:43.940 --> 00:18:45.890
Check the tape!

00:18:45.890 --> 00:18:48.300
There's no tape, obviously.

00:18:48.300 --> 00:18:49.700
We're...

00:18:49.700 --> 00:18:51.400
...fine with a draw.

00:18:51.400 --> 00:18:54.780
Haruka-sama, please
do something about this.

00:18:54.780 --> 00:18:55.880
Don't worry.

00:18:55.880 --> 00:18:58.330
Soak them in clean water
and they'll change back.

00:18:58.330 --> 00:18:59.850
Whew!

00:18:59.850 --> 00:19:03.400
I'm just fine like this!

00:19:04.830 --> 00:19:06.050
Aw!

00:19:06.050 --> 00:19:07.460
Don't run away, you stupid dog!

00:19:07.460 --> 00:19:09.530
That's so cold.

00:19:09.530 --> 00:19:12.080
Asuka and her gang never showed.

00:19:12.080 --> 00:19:13.390
Yeah.

00:19:14.930 --> 00:19:16.160
What's this?

00:19:16.160 --> 00:19:17.500
A shinobi kekkai barrier?

00:19:17.500 --> 00:19:19.070
You've finally showed yourselves.

00:19:19.070 --> 00:19:20.530
I was getting sick of waiting.

00:19:23.030 --> 00:19:25.000
I've never seen you before.

00:19:25.000 --> 00:19:26.510
I'm Gekkou.

00:19:26.510 --> 00:19:28.080
I'm Senkou.

00:19:28.080 --> 00:19:31.750
Were you the ones
who sent the invitations?

00:19:31.750 --> 00:19:32.730
We are.

00:19:32.730 --> 00:19:34.570
Then let's hear it!

00:19:38.320 --> 00:19:39.470
Miyabi!

00:19:39.470 --> 00:19:40.400
I'm fine.

00:19:40.400 --> 00:19:41.730
There was no real damage.

00:19:43.330 --> 00:19:44.640
Calm down.

00:19:44.640 --> 00:19:48.830
We invited you here to see if
you're willing to participate.

00:19:48.830 --> 00:19:49.820
What?

00:19:49.820 --> 00:19:51.690
We're here to announce

00:19:51.690 --> 00:19:57.840
the battle to determine the 
strongest shinobi, the Shinobi Masters.

00:19:57.840 --> 00:19:59.650
Shinobi Masters?

00:20:00.290 --> 00:20:04.840
You think we'd go along with something
proposed by suspicious people like you?

00:20:06.640 --> 00:20:09.600
Will you still say that after you see this?

00:20:15.320 --> 00:20:19.410
If you don't participate, they're dead.

00:20:21.150 --> 00:20:23.970
We'll tell you where it's being held later.

00:20:23.970 --> 00:20:27.510
Until then, hone your skills.

00:20:31.210 --> 00:20:33.180
Gekkou and Senkou...

00:20:33.180 --> 00:20:36.310
They defeated the girls
from Hanzo Academy?

00:20:36.310 --> 00:20:38.220
But what's going on?

00:20:38.220 --> 00:20:38.940
Yes.

00:20:38.940 --> 00:20:42.130
Four of the Hanzo girls were captured.

00:20:42.130 --> 00:20:43.250
That's right.

00:20:43.250 --> 00:20:45.190
Asuka wasn't there.

00:20:51.810 --> 00:20:52.970
Yumi-chan...

00:20:53.800 --> 00:20:56.210
Come alone. We need to talk.

00:20:56.820 --> 00:20:58.810
Yumi, what is it?

00:20:59.850 --> 00:21:01.920
I remembered something I have to do.

00:21:01.920 --> 00:21:04.180
Go home without me.

00:21:04.180 --> 00:21:05.270
All right.

00:21:05.270 --> 00:21:07.900
Don't be out too late!

00:21:14.930 --> 00:21:17.160
Here, Yumi-chan.

00:21:21.530 --> 00:21:22.660
Asuka-san...

00:21:23.420 --> 00:21:26.070
I'm glad you're okay. I was worried.

00:21:26.070 --> 00:21:27.930
Did you hear about the Shinobi Masters?

00:21:27.930 --> 00:21:30.200
You know about it already?

00:21:30.200 --> 00:21:32.580
Then the girls from Hanzo Academy—

00:21:32.580 --> 00:21:34.010
I won't let you participate.

00:21:34.680 --> 00:21:37.210
I won't let you participate
in the Shinobi Masters.

00:21:37.210 --> 00:21:39.210
What are you saying?

00:21:41.880 --> 00:21:43.700
I realized...

00:21:43.700 --> 00:21:46.240
There is no justice for shinobi.

00:21:46.240 --> 00:21:49.320
Both sword and shield are meaningless.

00:21:50.830 --> 00:21:52.670
Asuka-san!

00:23:26.430 --> 00:23:29.420
Where is Kagura-san?

00:23:29.420 --> 00:23:31.860
No, if there are breasts...

00:23:32.320 --> 00:23:34.430
Let me fondle them!

00:23:34.430 --> 00:23:38.430
Okay, Mirai... give it up.

00:23:38.430 --> 00:23:41.230
A hot spring?
